    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">1.</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
    votes cast with respect to the proposal to elect the following Class B directors, Brian Nelson and Jonathan Bellows, as directors
    of the Company to hold office until the 2027 annual meeting and until his or her successor has been duly elected and qualified, or,
    if sooner, until the director&#8217;s death, resignation or removal, were as follows: </span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

